## 1. API Endpoint Reference

### API #66 — List Job Applications

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `GET` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/get_job_applications/:jobId` |
| **Auth** | Bearer Token (COLLEGEADMIN or TPO) |

#### Query Parameters

| Param | Type | Required | Description |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `application_status` | string | ❌ | Filter: `pending`, `under_review`, `shortlisted`, `rejected`, `selected`, `offered`, `withdrawn` |
| `is_eligible` | string | ❌ | Filter: `true` or `false` |
| `position_id` | UUID | ❌ | Filter by position |
| `search` | string | ❌ | Search student name, email, PRN, roll no |
| `applied_after` | ISO date | ❌ | Filter applications after this date |
| `applied_before` | ISO date | ❌ | Filter applications before this date |
| `sort_by` | string | ❌ | `applied_at` (default), `last_updated_at`, `student_name`, `application_status` |
| `sort_order` | string | ❌ | `asc` or `desc` (default) |
| `page` | number | ❌ | Default: 1 |
| `limit` | number | ❌ | Default: 10, max: 100 |

#### Example URL
```
GET /api/college/get_job_applications/4b5b6516-...?application_status=pending&sort_by=applied_at&sort_order=desc&page=1&limit=20
```

#### Success Response (200)

