### API #68 — Update Application Status

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `PATCH` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/update_application_status/:applicationId` |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "application_status": "shortlisted",
  "remarks": "Strong technical profile, proceed to interview"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Valid Values |
|-------|------|----------|-------------|
| `application_status` | string | ✅ | `under_review`, `shortlisted`, `rejected`, `selected`, `offered` |
| `remarks` | string | ❌ | max 1000 chars |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Admin **cannot** set `pending` (auto-set on apply) or `withdrawn` (student-only action).

#### Status Transition Rules

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: Student applies
    pending --> under_review
    pending --> shortlisted
    pending --> rejected
    under_review --> shortlisted
    under_review --> rejected
    shortlisted --> selected
    shortlisted --> rejected
    selected --> offered
    selected --> rejected
    offered --> rejected
    
    note right of rejected: Terminal (admin)
    note left of withdrawn: Terminal (student)
```

