### API #69 — Bulk Update Application Status

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/bulk_update_application_status` |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "application_ids": [
    "a1b2c3d4-...",
    "e5f6g7h8-...",
    "i9j0k1l2-..."
  ],
  "application_status": "shortlisted",
  "remarks": "Cleared aptitude test"
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Validation |
|-------|------|----------|------------|
| `application_ids` | UUID[] | ✅ | 1–100 UUIDs |
| `application_status` | string | ✅ | Admin-settable statuses |
| `remarks` | string | ❌ | max 1000 chars |

#### Response — Shows updated/skipped/errors

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Bulk update complete: 2 updated, 1 skipped",
  "data": {
    "new_status": "shortlisted",
    "summary": { "total_requested": 3, "updated": 2, "skipped": 1, "errors": 0 },
    "updated_ids": ["a1b2c3d4-...", "e5f6g7h8-..."],
