## 3. Integration Guide

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Job Postings] --> B[Applications ✨ NEW]
    C[Job Positions] --> B
    D[App Questions] --> E[App Answers]
    B --> E
    F[Job Rounds] --> G[Round Results]
    B --> G
    B --> H["Placement Results ❌ Future"]
```

### Data Flow
1. Job published → students apply (creates application record)
2. Admin views applications → filters/searches → opens detail
3. Admin reviews answers + academic info → changes status
4. Admin uses bulk update for batch processing
5. Shortlisted students → proceed to rounds → round results
6. Selected students → offered → placement records (future)

### Frontend Navigation
```
Job Detail Page → Rounds Tab / Questions Tab
               → Applications Tab  ← THIS MODULE
                    → Application List (paginated)
                    → Click row → Application Detail (answers + rounds)
                    → Status buttons / Bulk actions
```

