## 4. Date Edge Cases Covered

| Scenario | How Handled |
|----------|-------------|
| Filter by date range (`applied_after` + `applied_before`) | ISO date validated, converted to timestamp comparison |
| Timezone differences | Dates stored as `TIMESTAMP WITHOUT TIME ZONE`; frontend should send UTC or local consistently |
| `applied_before` < `applied_after` | Returns 0 results (no error — this is the expected SQL behavior) |
| Null `applied_at` | Cannot happen — defaults to `NOW()` on insertion |
| `last_updated_at` sorting | Updated on every status change via `NOW()` |

